/**
 * nav-multilevel-menu — vendored from the UI Engine preset library (axiestudio).
 * Install: npx shadcn@latest add https://axiestudio.github.io/UI_Engine/registry/r/nav-multilevel-menu.json
 * Source of truth: UI/ — do not edit vendored copies blindly.
